  "pli-tv-kd10:2.1.14": "Sp 3.456: <i lang='pi' translate='no'>Ekekaṁ āsanaṁ antaraṁ katvā nisīditabbaṁ</i>, “They should sit down, having made a gap between each seat.” Presumably this refers to any situation where monks from different sides are sitting next to each other. ",
