  "pli-tv-kd10:3.1.25": "Sp 3.464: <i lang='pi' translate='no'>Ye ca tattha vijānantīti ye tattha paṇḍitā “mayaṁ maccusamīpaṁ gacchāmā”ti vijānanti</i>, “<i lang='pi' translate='no'>Ye ca tattha vijānanti</i>: those there who are wise, they understand: ‘We are going close to death.’” ",
  "pli-tv-kd10:3.1.26": "Sp 3.464: <i lang='pi' translate='no'>Tato sammanti medhagāti evañhi te jānantā yonisomanasikāraṁ uppādetvā medhagānaṁ kalahānaṁ vūpasamāya paṭipajjanti</i>, “<i lang='pi' translate='no'>Tato sammanti medhagā</i>: for they know this by giving rise to wise attention. They practice for the ending of quarrel and strife.” ",
